@title Cabinet: box select three devices, drag them together, undo and redo restore the whole group
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1920x1080
# Box select (drag on empty plate) takes F1, F2 and F3 of the lesson cabinet. A drag on one of them
# carries all three. One undo puts all three back, one redo moves all three again.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
move 700 700
shot before
check_layout
drag 1090 160 905 262
wait 15
move 700 700
wait 5
expect "Align"
expect "3 selected"
expect "55, 10 mm"
shot box-selected
drag 1009 207 1250 590
wait 20
move 700 700
wait 5
expect_not "55, 10 mm"
shot group-dragged
check_layout
click 497 19
wait 15
move 700 700
wait 5
expect "55, 10 mm"
shot undone-whole-group
click 522 19
wait 15
move 700 700
wait 5
expect_not "55, 10 mm"
shot redone-whole-group
